Package: sardine
Title: Epigenetic Clock and Phenotype Associations from EWAS Summary Statistics
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Ryan", "Moreno", email = "rrmoreno@wisc.edu", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Yuchang", "Wu", email = "ywu423@wisc.edu", role = "aut")
  )
Description: Estimates the association between an epigenetic clock and a
    phenotype using only summary statistics from an epigenome-wide association
    study (EWAS), the clock's CpG weights, and a reference DNA methylation
    covariance matrix. No individual-level data is required. Handles linear,
    logistic and Cox proportional hazards EWAS models, either regression
    direction, and beta-value or M-value methylation scales.
License: GPL (>= 3)
URL: https://github.com/qlu-lab/SARDINE
